# ---- settings.js ----
msgid "%s (recorded as %s)"
msgstr "%s（记录为 %s）"

msgid "%s (no gateway)"
msgstr "%s（无网关）"

msgid "%s (not found)"
msgstr "%s（未找到）"

msgid "LibreSpeed – Settings"
msgstr "LibreSpeed – 设置"

msgid "Measurement"
msgstr "测量"

msgid "Logical interface measured by default: by the Test page unless another one is chosen there, and by an automatic test that names no interface."
msgstr "默认测量的逻辑接口：测速页未另行选择时使用此接口，未指定接口的自动测量亦然。"

msgid "Server list URL"
msgstr "服务器列表 URL"

msgid "URL of a LibreSpeed server list in JSON, from a self-hosted deployment: either a static file such as https://example.org/servers.json or a generator such as https://example.org/backend/servers.php. Leave empty for the official list."
msgstr "LibreSpeed 服务器列表的 JSON 地址（自建部署）：可以是静态文件（如 https://example.org/servers.json）或生成器（如 https://example.org/backend/servers.php）。留空则使用官方列表。"

msgid "Must be an http(s) URL"
msgstr "必须是 http(s) 开头的 URL"

msgid "On routers without AES acceleration, TLS itself can bound the result — forcing plain HTTP then measures the line rather than the cipher."
msgstr "无 AES 加速的路由器上，TLS 本身可能限制结果——强制明文 HTTP 可测量线路而非加密开销。"

msgid "force HTTPS"
msgstr "强制 HTTPS"

msgid "force HTTP"
msgstr "强制 HTTP"

msgid "Scheduled measurements"
msgstr "定时测量"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Runs a measurement from cron at the chosen interval. Note that a measurement saturates the connection while it runs."
msgstr "由 cron 按所选间隔执行测量。注意：测量期间会占满带宽。"

msgid "Days"
msgstr "星期"

msgid "Leave empty to run every day. A weekly test runs on one of the chosen days, or on any day when none is chosen; the day is drawn once and kept while it stays among the chosen days."
msgstr "留空则每天执行。每周测速在所选的某天运行；全不选则不限。抽取的结果会保留，只要其仍处于所选范围内。"

msgid "Hours"
msgstr "小时"

msgid "An hour window on the 24-hour clock, such as 2-5 for 02:00–05:59. A daily or weekly measurement runs at a random time inside it, drawn when the schedule is applied; shorter intervals only run within it. Leave empty for any time. A window across midnight is not supported."
msgstr "24 小时制的小时窗口，如 2-5 表示 02:00–05:59。每日/每周测量会在窗口内随机取时执行，更短间隔的测量也只在该窗口内运行。留空则不限时间。不支持跨午夜窗口。"

msgid "Default interface"
msgstr "默认接口"

msgid "Choose the interface this test measures."
msgstr "选择此测速使用的接口。"

msgid "Another enabled automatic test already measures %s."
msgstr "已有一个启用的自动测速任务在测量 %s。"

msgid "Interval"
msgstr "间隔"

msgid "The interval %s is not supported. Use 1-59m, 1-23h, 1d or 7d."
msgstr "不支持间隔 %s。可用 1-59m、1-23h、1d 或 7d。"

msgid "Use an hour (0-23) or a range like 2-5"
msgstr "请输入小时（0-23）或范围（如 2-5）"

msgid "The window must not cross midnight"
msgstr "时间窗口不能跨午夜"

msgid "Keep history"
msgstr "保留历史"

msgid "Path"
msgstr "路径"

msgid "History stored in /tmp is lost when the router reboots."
msgstr "保存在 /tmp 的历史会在路由器重启后丢失。"

msgid "Retention"
msgstr "保留时长"

msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7 天"

msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 天"

msgid "90 days"
msgstr "90 天"

msgid "1 year"
msgstr "1 年"

msgid "Archive path"
msgstr "归档路径"

msgid "Completed days are reduced to daily minimum, average and maximum and appended here once a day, so measurements since the last flush may be lost after an unexpected power loss. Leave empty to keep no persistent history."
msgstr "已完成的日期会压缩为当日最小值/均值/最大值并每天归档一次，意外断电可能丢失上次归档后的明细。留空则不保留持久历史。"

msgid "Archive retention"
msgstr "归档保留时长"

msgid "2 years"
msgstr "2 年"

msgid "Upcoming measurements"
msgstr "即将进行的测量"

msgid "The time of a daily measurement is drawn anew whenever the schedule is applied. A weekly measurement keeps its drawn day and time while they fit the chosen days and hours."
msgstr "每次应用计划时会重新抽取每日测量的时间。每周测量在所选星期与小时范围内保留已抽取的日期和时间。"

msgid "No schedule is active. Enable it above and apply to draw the measurement time."
msgstr "当前没有启用的计划。在上方启用并应用以抽取测量时间。"
